note right of AdminController
  Admin endpoints:
  - getAllVibesAdmin: List all vibes
    with pagination and filters
  - getVibeDetailAdmin: Get single vibe
    with comments
  - getVibesWithFilters: Advanced filtering
    by name, category, price, etc.
end note

note right of VibeModel
  Methods handle:
